1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,000
So, this is the answer to all the riddles.

2
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:12,900
Here in the wild I have you:

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,400
two halflings and a host of men at my call.

4
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,200
The Ring of Power within my grasp.

5
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:38,200
A chance for Faramir, Captain of Gondor,

6
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:42,900
to show his quality.

7
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,500
No!

8
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,200
Don't you understand?

9
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:58,200
He's got to destroy it!

10
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:00,000
Osgiliath is under attack.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,500
They call for reinforcements.

12
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,600
Please.

13
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,900
It's such a burden.

14
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,400
Will you not help him?

15
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,100
Captain.

16
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:14,100
Prepare to leave.
